{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Accelerate renewable energy adoption with increased investment",
        "additional_details": "The UK is facing record heatwaves, flooding and unstable weather. This is becoming the new normal and threatens the future we leave our children. We call on the Government to urgently cut emissions, expand renewable energy, support households to adopt low carbon technology, and invest in climate adaptation to protect communities from extreme weather.",
        "background": "Increase investment in UK renewable energy infrastructure. Increase the number and accessibility of grants and incentives for households to adopt solar, heat pumps, and other low carbon technologies. Strengthen regulation of industrial emissions and accelerate the transition away from fossil fuels.",
